{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfu1XakRmVZfX2VrHWdXZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Fix first: Step 3, the login wall\n\n**Step 3 is a dead end.** People who forgot their password are asked to log in before they can reset it. Most of them can't, so they call. This is most likely why resets are your second-biggest call driver, and it matters more than the other steps combined.\n\n**Sprint plan:**\n1. **Remove the login requirement.** The single-use, short-lived token in the email link should be what proves who the user is. Because this is a bank, add a step-up check that isn't the password, such as an SMS or email OTP or a device-binding check. Expire the token after one use and after about 15–30 minutes. Notify the user on all channels when the reset finishes.\n2. **Open the link in the app** using iOS Universal Links and Android App Links. Keep a working mobile-web reset as the fallback for users who don't have the app installed.\n\n**Cheap fixes to add if there's room (about a day each):**\n- **Step 4:** Show the password rules before the user types, with a live checklist. A failed attempt that just says \"does not meet requirements\" causes needless retries and calls. Show \"can't reuse a recent password\" as a server-side message after submit.\n- **Step 1:** On small screens, put the \"Forgot password\" link next to the password field so it's visible without scrolling.\n\n**Leave alone:** Step 2. \"If an account exists…\" is correct. It stops attackers from using the reset form to check which emails have accounts. You could add a hint like \"Check spam, or try another email you use\" and a resend timer.\n\n**Check before and after:** Ask support to tag reset calls by where the caller got stuck. That confirms Step 3 is the main cause and gives you a baseline to show the fix worked."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3190,"cache_read_input_tokens":5101,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3190},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d5a6294e-eb96-4cf9-895c-20f34ab4e469","uuid":"c2953e49-fd8e-419b-ad52-daaa2be5b7b3","timestamp":"2026-10-10T18:13:23.526Z","request_id":"req_011Cfu1XaUoDcs2q2MdWzGE6"}
